{"title": "Rolan's Colour Spray", "pageid": 35275, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rolan's_Colour_Spray", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 1 Spells", "Illusion spells", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Colour_Spray\" title=\"Colour Spray\">Colour Spray</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Colour_Spray.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Colour_Spray.webp/300px-Colour_Spray.webp, /w/images/a/ad/Colour_Spray.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ad/Colour_Spray.webp/300px-Colour_Spray.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ad/Colour_Spray.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Rolan's Colour Spray </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 1 illusion spell</a>. This spell is a variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Colour_Spray\" title=\"Colour Spray\">Colour Spray</a> spell, unique to <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a>. It cannot be learned by party members.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nCreate an illustrious display of flashing lights to dazzle and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confused_(Condition)\" title=\"Confused (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confuse\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Confused_(Condition)\" title=\"Confused (Condition)\">Confuse</a> creatures up to a combined <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">44 hit points</span>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 5 m (17 ft) Cone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 5 m (17 ft) Cone</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Zone_LOW_Rolan_ColorSpray</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Zone_LOW_Rolan_ColorSpray\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Zone_LOW_Rolan_ColorSpray\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Confused\"> Condition: Confused </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Confused_(Condition)\" title=\"Confused (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Confused\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Confused_(Condition)\" title=\"Confused (Condition)\">Confused</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">hostile</a> to everyone, wanders around aimlessly, and occasionally skips turns in its stupor</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell cannot be learned by a playable character. It is only available to <a href=\"/wiki/Rolan\" title=\"Rolan\">Rolan</a>.</li>\n<li>Uniquely, while it costs a spell slot to use, it does not mention any level requirement for the spell slot.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715050630\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2503/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31310/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11373/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1158630/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.60%   58.774     30 Template:Trim\n100.00%   58.425      1 -total\n 98.65%   57.638      1 Template:Feature_page\n 19.70%   11.511      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.53%    7.907      1 Template:Resource\n 12.17%    7.110      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 11.55%    6.750      1 Template:Condition\n 10.32%    6.030      3 Template:Icon_text\n 10.19%    5.952      1 Template:Cond\n  9.61%    5.614      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35275-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715050630 and revision id 279099. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}